  "solution": {
    "text": "<p>Given linear equations are&nbsp;</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>y</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>z</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>&#945;</mi></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>&#945;</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>&#945;</mi><mi>y</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>3</mn><mi>z</mi><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>3</mn><mi>&#945;</mi><mi>y</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>5</mn><mi>z</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>4</mn></math></p><p>For this system of linear equations to have&nbsp;inconsistent solution</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>D</mi><mo>=</mo><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\"><mtable><mtr><mtd><mn>1</mn></mtd><mtd><mn>1</mn></mtd><mtd><mn>1</mn></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mi>&#945;</mi></mtd><mtd><mn>2</mn><mi>&#945;</mi></mtd><mtd><mn>3</mn></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mn>1</mn></mtd><mtd><mn>3</mn><mi>&#945;</mi></mtd><mtd><mn>5</mn></mtd></mtr></mtable></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><msup><mfenced><mrow><mi>&#945;</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>&#945;</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></math></p><p>Now for&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>&#945;</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>D</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\"><mtable><mtr><mtd><mn>1</mn></mtd><mtd><mn>1</mn></mtd><mtd><mn>1</mn></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mtd><mtd><mn>2</mn></mtd><mtd><mn>3</mn></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mn>4</mn></mtd><mtd><mn>3</mn></mtd><mtd><mn>5</mn></mtd></mtr></mtable></mfenced></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><mfenced><mrow><mn>10</mn><mo>-</mo><mn>9</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>-</mo><mfenced><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>5</mn><mo>-</mo><mn>12</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>+</mo><mfenced><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>-</mo><mn>8</mn></mrow></mfenced></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>17</mn><mo>-</mo><mn>11</mn><mo>&#8800;</mo><mn>0</mn></math></p><p>Hence, for&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>&#945;</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></math>&nbsp;the system of equation has inconsistent solution.</p>",
